            <ArticleTitle>Intravascular therapeutic ultrasound thrombolysis in acute myocardial infarctions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>200-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Catheter-delivered, therapeutic ultrasound was shown to effectively dissolve thrombus in vitro and in vivo. This first study in 14 patients with acute myocardial infarctions demonstrates that it is a safe and effective treatment alternative that deserves further clinical evaluation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
